Every delta is an exact multiple of the frame size (w*h*3/2): one frame on the
still arm, two on videokey, three on inter — 2.46 / 4.92 / 7.37 M at 1280,
6.29 / 12.58 / 18.88 M at 2048. That is the arithmetic above, measured.

**Peak heap is now below C on all twelve cells.**

